{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t警方拘捕一名17歲少年，涉嫌猥褻16歲以下兒童。<br/>\n<br/>\n社交平台近日流傳一對年輕男女在土瓜灣海心公園海邊的影片，當中有人身穿校服。警方表示，九龍城警區刑事支援隊人員經深入調查後，拘捕一名17歲男童，涉嫌「向年齡在十六歲以下的兒童作出猥褻行為」。被捕人現正被扣留調查。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.473716+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:13:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:56.857043+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:56.857043+00:00","content_hash":"528c9237270385a3d8e3cf86bc299d8c6cac5bd704130f3eb87e17f39b19fc19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}